<title>ARGENTINA: TABLE - ARGENTINA'S CEI H1 NET $29.58 MLN.</title>
<headline>TABLE - ARGENTINA'S CEI H1 NET $29.58 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>BUENOS AIRES 1997-08-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Period to june 30.</p>
<p>Net $29.58 million vs n/a.</p>
<p>NOTE: The company provided no comparative, EPS or ADR information, or second quarter results. It reported a net worth of $1.08 billion and retained earnings of $421.03 million.  </p>
<p>Argentina's CEI Citicorp Holdings SA has a 50 percent stake in Compania de Inversiones en Telecomunicaciones SA (COINTEL), the holding company for Telefonica de Argentina.</p>
<p>The other half of COINTEL is owned by Telefonica de Espana.</p>
<p>CEI is about 40 percent indirectly owned by Citibank.</p>
<p>((--Guillermo Haskel, Buenos Aires newsroom, 541 318-0650))</p>
